t(1, 2395, """Do not say “Yusif”, say “Yusuf” - do not say “Yunis”, say “Yunus”""")

t(2, 125, """“Have those who believe not yet realized that, had Allah willed, He would have guided all mankind?”""")

t(2, 465, """How many of creation take an evil word lightly and find it easy to hurl accusations; they split open people's chests at the prompting of Satan, who deludes them that they speak truth and rightness. To which wicked soul has Allah Almighty unveiled the hidden secret of another, that it should say of so-and-so such-and-such evil and accuse him of what he is innocent of, while its owner's tongue is unbound in uttering offense, let loose, racing the wind in audacity and injustice. So, beautiful patience.""")

t(2, 925, """“And why should we not rely upon Allah, when He has guided us to our ways? We will surely be patient with whatever harm you do us. And upon Allah let those who rely place their reliance.”

“And We certainly know that your chest is tightened by what they say (97). So glorify the praise of your Lord and be among those who prostrate (98). And worship your Lord until certainty comes to you.”""")

t(2, 1390, """The ladder that is carried sideways: true, it crashes into people; true, it hurts them for a period of time; true, it wounds them and makes their blood flow. But in the end it breaks, shatters and stops causing people pain. A sure moment must come in which the ladder is shattered""")

t(3, 1830, """A society whose actions are monitored and which fears punishment is a society forced to improve its morals - except for the righteous men and righteous women""")

t(4, 830, """The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: ((The most hated of men to Allah is the most stubborn in dispute)) .. “Men” here does not mean the male kind only; rather it definitely includes women, who are covered by the hadith without any disagreement.
The black-hearted one who does not forget the problems that occur between him and people; stubborn in enmity, tyrannical, arrogant; whose heart never clears until the Hour comes; always in dispute; who acts as if he has no problem and acts as if he forgives; who, when an apology is offered to him in a matter that carries no legal hadd punishment, rejects the apology.""")

t(4, 1380, """Did you tell your Indian Muslim brother in the restaurant that he is lesser than you because you are of European origin?""")

t(5, 305, """Do not come to the mosque again with your shirt tucked into your trousers .. I have memorized your shape""")

t(5, 1740, """In the schools of the Arab countries the social counselor is absent, her role is absent, her value is absent, and absent from her are the tools that would enable her to bring reform on earth .. Boys and girls abused at home, their souls moaning, finding neither relief nor rest .. And schools that offer nothing but the curricula .. and drawing and sports classes .. The hearts of these children are sad and miserable .. When they stand in the schoolyard they see children laughing from their hearts, and they wonder: why are they happy and we are not?!""")

t(6, 945, """My father, whenever he sees me, humiliates me, crushes my personality and calls me every bad thing; not a minute passes without him saying to me: why did you do this, and why didn't you do that. I have come to ask for protection .. My mother, whenever she sees me, humiliates me and scolds me; I have been very patient, there is no solution with her, and I cry every night""")

t(6, 2545, """Every father in a neighborhood .. in a street .. in a building, from whose heart Allah has torn out mercy and who has dressed himself in sheep's skin over a wolf's heart, deserves to be reported to the security authorities by his neighbors, his relatives and his family. Every mother who has corrupted her innate nature (mercy) and tormented her child deserves to be reported to the security authorities by society""")

t(7, 270, """If only I had power against them! Every father and mother who torment their children are two criminals deserving punishment. The child is a trust; every father who betrays the trust is not a father, and every mother who betrays the trust is not a mother. Every mother who stays silent about her child's torments at the hands of his father is a mother who has betrayed the trust; the religion accepts from her neither repentance nor ransom. She is a partner in the injustice, a helper in it, shirking her responsibilities, selfish, seeking only her own interest!""")

t(7, 805, """When the case of a child tormented in his childhood comes to you, and then the case of a husband tormented in his marriage or a wife tormented in her marriage, say to the husband tormented in his marriage and the wife tormented in her marriage: go back home, you two have seen nothing of torment! Many people are tormented when they are grown adults and think that those torments of theirs are something worth mentioning and of great value; they do not know that those who were tormented in their childhood are the truly tormented, and that they, those grown adults, should not exaggerate much or delude themselves when they speak of their torments, for these are a complete zero before the torments of a child.""")

t(7, 1365, """The child tormented in his childhood will not bear much of the pain when he grows up. So he will always be ablaze, rejecting injustice, rebelling against anyone who tries to wrong him again. If only every person had written on his identity card: tormented in his childhood / not tormented in his childhood""")

t(7, 1765, """Whoever says, man or woman: a child, if tormented in his childhood, carries nothing of his torments with him to the end of his life - he or she who says it is among the most ignorant of Allah's creation""")

t(7, 2270, """When children are wronged, Jerusalem is lost a thousand times, the Ummah is humiliated for a thousand years, and poverty and subjugation by its enemy engulf the Ummah .. Children are the thermometer of any nation's soundness. When a child is wronged, the Great Lord, sanctified be His names and attributes, is angered on his behalf, but most people do not know that .. And how many a father and mother have been struck with killing, deadly blows because of preying on a child?! A truth that I know, and I do not know how many people know it.""")

t(7, 2590, """The child is an innocent soul. Many men today have had mercy torn from their hearts, and unfortunately they have become a danger to the child's growth and to his future""")

t(8, 395, """No one shows mercy to children as women do""")

t(8, 690, """Islam came so that Allah, our Great Lord, be worshipped - sanctified be His names, magnified in the heavens and on earth, and exalted greatly on high - and so that man may rejoice! To rejoice, not to weep. If man weeps, then Allah Almighty has never been worshipped as He truly deserves""")

t(8, 2350, """What is established in the authentic collections is that Constantinople, at the time of the second universality of Islam, returns to Europe once again, being the farthest tip of the European mainland. It appears that the Muslims withdraw to Anatolia and settle in Anatolia. Perhaps the Muslims of Istanbul remain; I do not assert that all of them remain. Most likely those of them who emigrate will emigrate to Anatolia or to other parts of the Islamic world, especially Bayt al-Maqdis. But whoever stays in Istanbul will of course be under European rule. This will have hard consequences for those who stay, and I do not assert the kind of those hardships: whether they reach what the Moriscos faced in Spain when Muslim rule fell there, or some other kind of hardship; it is a matter whose features are not clear in detail. As for Anatolia, it is - and Allah knows best - part of the rule of the Islamic world. Therefore the conquest at the end of time will be, Allah willing, for Istanbul only and not for all of Turkey.""")

t(9, 65, """The pictures have no relation to the subject.""")

t(11, 2205, """Whoever doubts that Allah Almighty owns everything in this universe, his heart shakes with terror of people! As for fear in the face of situations, it is innate nature and has nothing to do with certainty in Allah Almighty, because it is the pressure of the situation and its momentary effect. But the heart at peace does not tremble, nor does it fear with the fear of one who doubts the help of Allah Almighty""")

t(12, 75, """When the matter is entrusted to those unfit for it ------> the most ignorant of the ignorant speaks about religion""")

t(12, 300, """When the matter is entrusted to those unfit for it ------> the human soul is spoken about by one who knows nothing of it and thinks that the gatherings and chatter of his grandfather and uncles are enough to open a psychological clinic!""")

t(12, 765, """Whoever saddens a child over what he did not do and what is no fault of his has transgressed and acted the tyrant on earth""")

t(12, 1150, """Whoever Allah has blessed with a child and says to him: you are the cause of the ruin of the home - he has not only loaded a child with the responsibility for his failure in running his family, but has acted the tyrant on earth and been insolent""")

t(12, 1415, """Whoever Allah has blessed with a child and tells him that he is the cause of the loss of Jerusalem has acted the tyrant on earth""")

t(12, 1680, """Praise be to Allah for your safe arrival! I am an employee here to serve you. I am not an emperor! I am an employee whom the state has employed to make you happy and serve you, not to frighten you or look down on you! I am merely an employee! And if I mistreat any one of you, my punishment will be very great and severe""")

t(13, 765, """Companionship alone does not save! How many a doomed man and doomed woman attained companionship?! Was Pharaoh saved by his companionship with Asiya? And was the wife of Lot saved by her companionship with a prophet among the prophets (her husband)?""")

t(13, 1105, """He whose heart is humbled is certain that His command is carried out""")

t(13, 1410, """Prophethood is a rank, and messengership is a charge with a new legislation""")

t(13, 1715, """What matters is not that you arrive! What matters is that you stand firm! But the calamity of many people is that they arrive and do not care whether they stood firm or perished""")

t(13, 2010, """The most dangerous of people for people are the prophets! Whoever harms them has knocked on the door of punishment with both his hands""")

t(13, 2315, """He who was shown and then relapsed - perhaps he has been punished""")

t(14, 110, """We are here for one thing only! That our bodies live what they were naturally created upon, and that our souls live what they were created for. Between this and that there is a bridge over fire, a scale that shows no mercy, a Lord who shows mercy, and a soul that either grasps or stays ignorant. If it grasps, you have taken the path. So do not be a tyrant on earth for the sake of your lusts, do not be an insolent corrupter on earth for the sake of your soul's impulses, and do not be, for the sake of your desires, a project of torment who on the Day of Resurrection says: myself, then the Fire; myself, then the Fire; myself, then the Fire!""")

t(14, 580, """Do not fear the blaze of this world when it is heated against you, for the turning of your heart in grief and weeping is your entry ticket to the path of the prophets""")

t(14, 875, """What pollutes your heart is not that you have human needs; what pollutes your heart is that you seek them for yourself alone!
From here a thousand doors open to the devil of your soul!""")

t(14, 1265, """What pollutes your heart is not that you get angry for the truth; what pollutes your heart is that you are made angry at the truth!""")

t(14, 1565, """The heart is your door to heaven. Your need for a thousand books is over!""")

t(18, 255, """There circulates among (many) people a fabricated report about the Prophet ﷺ that he - far be it from him - brought his slave woman Mariyah the Copt to the bed of Lady Hafsa daughter of Umar, may Allah be pleased with them both. All the reports that came about this false story are forged and false; they were marketed among people for years as authentic, and many people do not verify.""")

t(18, 705, """I breastfed this baby girl 7 feedings .. more than 5, and she is now forbidden in marriage to my husband. I want to register her as a daughter under my care, mine and my husband's, with us at home""")

t(18, 2190, """You are a mother who did not abide by the law. You allowed your young daughter, who was not raised in the care of your new husband - you allowed her not to wear hijab in front of him, to laugh and joke with him and to be alone with him, and you considered her his stepdaughter, whereas the law is clear that she is not his stepdaughter. So his assault on her happened because of your disobedience to the law.""")

t(19, 1265, """We apologize to you, there is no adoption of orphans .. Adopting orphans is forbidden by Shariah""")

t(20, 115, """Public transport whose buses do not run on every street and in every alley wide enough for a bus to pass is public transport of no value! It equals zero! It is nothing but empty talk! Failed transport""")

t(20, 1600, """I am not an employee or a worker who came from overseas! I am their son! The state has employed me to serve them""")

t(21, 610, """I am married. My house is next to my parents' house. I am their only child. My husband is a Muslim who fears Allah. He knows that they have no one but me. He helps me to serve them and be dutiful to them.""")

t(21, 2130, """I have several siblings. The state appointed me to the job of caring for my elderly father and mother! I have a government job, and my job is to devote myself during the day to caring for my father and mother and looking after them""")

t(22, 1105, """I am my parents' only child! My profession is caring for them.""")
